<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_78b1273e-e88f-4371-8d75-d31b4c0142f5"
id="pt.2-he"><b>Appropriation for Legislature</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bf6448d5-d5ae-46be-9c0f-e18fef938817"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_711cb951-c4c5-4c42-8b4d-975e2ff12fdf"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Appropriation for services of
Legislature</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act appropriates the sum of $239,447,751 to
the Legislature out of the Consolidated Fund for the services of the
Legislature for the appropriation year.</txt></block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_4f8417d0-6f80-4b80-a2f8-0506ead5f3ef"
id="sec.4-note"><heading guid="_5ad3c88b-2e7f-47e5-8d2b-96853fb53df8"
id="sec.4-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The appropriation, together with funds from other
sources, is intended to fund&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8e83e8f9-21b0-443d-998e-9e32d2e1c17a" id="sec.4-note-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">expenses to the sum of $246,999,042,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_14a8d07c-d8ea-48cc-bdd5-056e7cbcd4b7" id="sec.4-note-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">capital expenditure to the sum of
$40,093,000.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></note>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_37091e80-a6af-4e64-984a-672091b3d9d7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading guid="_00ac8aa7-0f03-4982-88f1-711aed37d2f9"
id="pt.3-he"><b>General</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_51987542-7409-45a6-b57c-071248a2935f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_6bf0496c-5530-446a-93bc-2eac43ae95cf"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Payments authorised on lapse of
appropriation</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An amount is taken to have been expended out of a
sum appropriated for a purpose by this Act if the amount&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_50dc814b-8673-4a34-a3de-8d6aab34fbde" id="sec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">was paid for the purpose under the <legref
refid="act-2018-055" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act 2018</i></name></legref>,
section 4.10, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_14c43273-fe78-40fd-a3ad-711fd8f54d3a" id="sec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">was paid during the appropriation year and before
the date of assent to this Act.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>
</level>
</content>


